# The refusal cases of the OpenAPI corpus. Each file under invalid/ was
# written for panproto from the OpenAPI 3.1.2 specification to break one
# rule; an upstream/ file listed here is an unchanged upstream document the
# reader refuses: the meta-schema's fail cases, and three pass cases that
# break a MUST of the specification text the meta-schema does not check.
# Columns: file, JSON pointer of the refusal, refusal class, the rule broken.
